WEBVTT

00:20.850 --> 00:26.820
If I was dreaming, how did I forget?

00:26.890 --> 00:30.660
It pulsed through me, frigid, shocked me

00:30.660 --> 00:32.300
Can I do, do?

00:32.960 --> 00:37.960
I want you next to me when I summon you

00:39.130 --> 00:42.970
Waiting close by, but you seem far off

00:42.970 --> 00:45.310
Na, na, na, knight

00:45.310 --> 00:48.480
The more beautiful the rose

00:48.480 --> 00:51.450
The more its thorns hurt

00:51.450 --> 00:54.720
Now that I'm strong

00:54.720 --> 00:59.720
My heart knows to protect that vow

01:00.720 --> 01:03.760
Let's meet in the dark of night

01:03.760 --> 01:06.830
Where you're waiting

01:06.830 --> 01:09.830
You'll worship the cruel Dark Queen

01:09.830 --> 01:13.000
Who's drunk with danger

01:13.000 --> 01:15.970
You shattered the glass sword

01:15.970 --> 01:18.940
You wielded without thinking

01:18.940 --> 01:21.880
Its shards glow in the night

01:21.880 --> 01:25.350
I lick your wounded fingers

01:44.270 --> 01:46.750
Sure is peaceful.

02:00.920 --> 02:03.490
Traveler of the Underworld Kerberot!

02:04.450 --> 02:06.430
I love getting into trouble!

02:07.090 --> 02:09.560
I'll force everyone...

02:09.560 --> 02:11.330
...back from the dead!

02:11.330 --> 02:13.690
She's really persistant, by the way.

02:13.700 --> 02:17.000
Traveler of the Underworld, Kerberot!

02:17.000 --> 02:19.340
Oh, it's that time already?

02:19.870 --> 02:21.510
Flan!

02:25.310 --> 02:27.040
Flandre!

02:27.040 --> 02:29.020
My sister is calling for you.

02:38.050 --> 02:39.690
Flandre?

02:47.660 --> 02:49.300
Huga...

03:05.250 --> 03:08.120
Flandre is acting strange?

03:08.120 --> 03:11.650
She tried to attack me out of nowhere!

03:11.650 --> 03:15.090
It's because you were getting in her way
while she was doing the yard work.

03:15.090 --> 03:17.830
Hiro's such an idiot.

03:17.830 --> 03:21.670
You mustn't get in Flan's way
while she's working.

03:23.230 --> 03:25.640
No one believes me?!

03:27.970 --> 03:31.470
Could you not wake me up for things like this?

03:32.940 --> 03:35.180
A lack of sleep is beauty's enemy.

03:35.410 --> 03:37.240
Forget all that,

03:37.250 --> 03:40.650
can you go call Flan and tell her
that I recorded Kerberot,

03:40.650 --> 03:43.190
and ask her if she'll come watch it with me?

03:46.660 --> 03:49.330
Nobody believes me.

03:49.830 --> 03:54.530
Well, you are accusing Flandre,
of all people, of attacking you.

03:54.530 --> 03:56.460
No one's gonna believe that.

03:56.470 --> 03:58.270
It's the truth!

04:01.040 --> 04:02.670
Flandre!

04:06.270 --> 04:08.480
Huga!

04:15.450 --> 04:17.090
Hiro!

04:23.690 --> 04:27.000
What the hell are you doing, chewing gum?!

04:33.840 --> 04:35.640
An iron nut?

04:39.170 --> 04:43.090
I get it. This is what Hiro was referring to.

04:46.920 --> 04:48.720
You challenging me?

04:49.890 --> 04:51.690
You've got guts!

04:52.090 --> 04:53.730
Huga!

05:03.700 --> 05:05.510
No way!

05:09.040 --> 05:10.680
And?

05:11.870 --> 05:17.020
You raced Flandre on the mountain pass
and lost handily?

05:17.410 --> 05:19.750
I woulda won if a full moon was out!

05:19.750 --> 05:21.250
I would have!

05:21.250 --> 05:23.730
But you lost handily?

05:24.090 --> 05:26.120
Stop antagonizing me!

05:26.790 --> 05:31.430
Hime, Flandre really is acting strange.

05:31.430 --> 05:33.240
That's absurd.

05:41.570 --> 05:44.310
Huga... Huga...

05:48.240 --> 05:50.050
You're right.

05:50.480 --> 05:52.290
Right?

05:53.780 --> 05:55.450
Oh, there you are.

05:55.450 --> 05:58.860
Flan, will you come watch Kerberot with me?

05:59.890 --> 06:02.320
Watch it later! Watch it later, okay?

06:02.320 --> 06:03.020
Hiro!

06:08.960 --> 06:10.770
Watch out!

06:17.040 --> 06:19.880
Flandre, you...

06:35.820 --> 06:37.460
Hime!

06:38.390 --> 06:40.200
Don't, Flandre!

06:41.500 --> 06:43.840
Hiro, I'm here to play with you.

06:50.510 --> 06:52.210
Oh, Hiro!

06:52.210 --> 06:55.420
I don't know what to do
when you're that happy to see me!

06:58.610 --> 07:00.250
Huga?

07:01.780 --> 07:03.420
Flandre!

07:04.190 --> 07:06.170
Go, Francesca!

07:06.790 --> 07:08.430
Huga.

07:11.730 --> 07:14.190
Huga! Huga...(repeat)

07:14.200 --> 07:16.470
What's going on here?

07:16.870 --> 07:18.830
Huga...(repeat)

07:18.830 --> 07:20.470
Huga!

07:23.510 --> 07:26.490
Huga. Huga.

07:26.610 --> 07:33.460
I've never heard of an android
attacking her master before.

07:37.720 --> 07:39.650
Huga!

07:39.650 --> 07:41.690
Flandre, we're examining you. Stay still.

07:45.390 --> 07:48.760
Huga! Huga! Huga! Huga! Huga!

07:48.760 --> 07:51.370
Hurry and do something...

07:53.500 --> 07:55.540
The user's manual!

07:55.540 --> 07:58.210
We might figure it out if we read that!

07:58.210 --> 07:59.950
There's a user's manual?

08:00.410 --> 08:03.980
Oh, I left that in the Royal Kingdom.

08:03.980 --> 08:05.650
You too?

08:05.650 --> 08:08.520
Go read it and fix her!

08:08.520 --> 08:11.050
I'm not reading something that thick.

08:12.250 --> 08:14.230
Did you read it?

08:15.160 --> 08:20.130
I... I read about two pages and got bored.

08:20.130 --> 08:21.940
What about it?

08:22.830 --> 08:25.900
Stop talking about your lack of
interest in reading, you two!

08:25.900 --> 08:28.370
HUQB! Huga!

08:28.370 --> 08:31.650
Huga, huga, huga! Huga!

08:39.050 --> 08:41.150
Oh? An earthquake?

08:41.650 --> 08:45.260
My goodness, they are so loud.

08:58.100 --> 08:59.770
Hiro! You all right?

08:59.770 --> 09:02.210
S..Somehow...

09:04.140 --> 09:05.570
Where's Flandre?

09:05.570 --> 09:07.210
Sister...

09:10.480 --> 09:12.550
Looks like she wants to go outside.

09:12.550 --> 09:14.530
After her, Hiro, Liza!

09:16.220 --> 09:17.990
Don't order me around!

09:18.520 --> 09:21.590
Hey, wait for me.

09:25.690 --> 09:29.230
Oh? Do they not want tea?

09:31.070 --> 09:32.870
Sister, we'll go, too.

09:32.870 --> 09:34.510
Wait!

09:35.200 --> 09:37.380
I have something I want to research.

09:43.040 --> 09:45.510
Flandre is heading into town!

09:45.510 --> 09:49.320
This is bad! We can't let her go wild there.

09:49.320 --> 09:51.390
We have to find a way to stop her!

09:58.130 --> 09:59.760
Flandre!

10:00.660 --> 10:02.300
Huga.

10:06.400 --> 10:09.080
Oh, crap, I fell asleep at the wheel.

10:10.840 --> 10:13.450
Liza! The road! The road!

10:26.550 --> 10:30.370
Huga! Huga! Huga...

10:34.860 --> 10:36.500
Huga.

10:38.370 --> 10:40.350
Sister, that's...

10:42.870 --> 10:45.580
Just as I thought.

11:04.490 --> 11:08.000
Someone... Someone, please help!

11:08.000 --> 11:11.270
She went to get a cat out of a tree and
is afraid to come down now.

11:11.270 --> 11:14.870
Hang in there! A rescue squad is on the way.

11:28.580 --> 11:30.220
Huga!

11:35.990 --> 11:37.630
Momma!

11:45.530 --> 11:47.840
The park is a mess!

11:48.400 --> 11:51.040
Flandre really did it this time.

11:54.110 --> 11:56.750
Sorry, everyone! Sorry!

11:57.210 --> 12:00.060
Hold it right there! Hold it!

12:02.880 --> 12:04.520
Huga.

12:10.020 --> 12:11.690
Be quiet!

12:11.690 --> 12:14.040
If you don't wanna die, hand over the money!

12:23.500 --> 12:25.980
Hey! Hold it!

12:30.950 --> 12:32.580
Huga.

12:39.750 --> 12:41.560
Damn it!

12:42.620 --> 12:44.600
Sorry about this.

12:45.390 --> 12:47.870
She's normally a really good girl.

12:49.360 --> 12:51.630
Go back to the mansion, Flandre!

12:51.630 --> 12:54.410
You're malfunctioning somehow!

12:56.640 --> 12:58.880
You little punk...

13:03.110 --> 13:04.750
Huga!

13:06.050 --> 13:08.080
The chase is over.

13:11.990 --> 13:13.850
Live on the scene.

13:13.860 --> 13:17.820
A male bank robber at Sasanaki Bank
was apprehended.

13:17.830 --> 13:22.830
This really happened!

13:23.900 --> 13:26.830
We've also been given word that a young girl
trapped in a tree in a nearby park

13:26.830 --> 13:32.410
was also rescued by this little girl in a maid outfit.

13:36.040 --> 13:37.180
Oh dear, what's Flan doing there?

13:43.380 --> 13:45.690
Wh..What should I do?

13:45.690 --> 13:47.430
Gotcha.

13:51.760 --> 13:53.830
Huga!

13:55.560 --> 13:58.700
H..Hey! Look up there!

13:58.700 --> 14:00.540
A..A fire!

14:03.640 --> 14:05.910
That's enough, Flandre!

14:05.910 --> 14:07.070
Huga.

14:07.080 --> 14:09.880
Flandre, it's me!

14:09.880 --> 14:11.690
Me, Hiro!

14:12.150 --> 14:13.780
Huga!

14:20.790 --> 14:22.890
The fire's out!

14:22.890 --> 14:24.860
The cute maid saves the day again.

14:24.860 --> 14:26.740
She's awesome!

14:41.610 --> 14:45.420
I don't think she's going to stop soon, Sister.

15:02.830 --> 15:04.640
What's that?

15:05.070 --> 15:08.940
S..Someone is trespassing into the power plant.

15:08.940 --> 15:11.010
Switching to the monitor.

15:12.210 --> 15:14.310
A..A maid?!

15:28.690 --> 15:31.490
You in the maid outfit, stop right there!

15:31.490 --> 15:34.130
This area is for authorized personnel only!

15:42.970 --> 15:44.610
Huga!

15:51.150 --> 15:54.250
You don't think she's going to
go crazy in there, do you?

15:55.120 --> 15:57.030
If she does...

15:59.220 --> 16:02.430
Hu..ga...

16:05.730 --> 16:08.560
The town will be screwed!

16:08.560 --> 16:11.270
Hey! Can't you do something?

16:12.470 --> 16:14.100
Hime!

16:14.570 --> 16:16.810
I guess I have no choice.

16:17.310 --> 16:21.340
I will lend you all my resources.

16:22.280 --> 16:24.110
Go, Francesca!

16:24.110 --> 16:25.750
Huga.

16:39.930 --> 16:42.500
Flandre's self-destruct function?!

16:42.500 --> 16:47.500
I'm not sure how it happened,
but something must have activated it.

16:47.840 --> 16:52.840
Don't tell me she's going to put
the entire city at risk?

16:53.040 --> 16:55.910
Flandre wouldn't do such a thing!

16:55.910 --> 16:58.450
I wouldn't put it past her, the way she's acting.

16:59.050 --> 17:00.680
No way...

17:05.490 --> 17:06.750
Huga!

17:11.860 --> 17:16.300
What do you plan to do if we
can't stop her, Sister?

17:16.300 --> 17:19.940
Take Francesca, Hiro and the others and escape.

17:21.300 --> 17:22.970
What about you?

17:22.970 --> 17:27.940
I'll stay here and watch Flandre until the very end.

17:28.410 --> 17:30.050
Hime...

17:33.050 --> 17:34.690
Hiro!

17:35.280 --> 17:37.580
I have to stop Flandre.

17:37.590 --> 17:39.790
That's impossible for you!

17:39.790 --> 17:42.090
You're talking about going up against Flandre!

17:42.090 --> 17:46.230
And you know, the way she is now,
she won't recognize you!

17:46.790 --> 17:51.630
But she might remember Hime.

17:51.630 --> 17:52.870
Hiro...

17:52.870 --> 17:57.650
I'm going. If I don't, I'll always regret
not helping Hime and Flandre!

18:03.180 --> 18:05.280
Huga!

18:07.950 --> 18:10.650
Huga! Huga! Huga! Huga!

18:10.650 --> 18:12.720
Huga!

18:24.670 --> 18:26.300
No!

18:27.030 --> 18:29.040
You can't do this, Flandre!

18:29.040 --> 18:31.310
Please, remember!

18:38.050 --> 18:40.360
Hime will be sad!

18:42.220 --> 18:43.850
Huga?

18:53.060 --> 18:55.300
Are you back, Flandre?

18:55.300 --> 18:56.660
Huga...

18:56.660 --> 18:57.600
Huga! Huga, Huga!

18:59.270 --> 19:01.370
Huga!

19:01.370 --> 19:03.780
Huga, huga, huga, huga, huga...

19:09.940 --> 19:13.210
What is it? What's she doing?

19:13.210 --> 19:16.990
Maybe she was heading towards
the ocean all along.

19:17.590 --> 19:22.590
We can't tell for sure what's
malfunctioning within her,

19:22.620 --> 19:25.930
but out of the little bit of loyalty she
still has towards my sister,

19:25.930 --> 19:29.960
she wanted to head out to sea to self-destruct.

19:29.960 --> 19:31.600
Flandre!

19:31.700 --> 19:34.840
Flandrel Don't do it!

20:14.280 --> 20:15.910
Huga.

20:21.020 --> 20:22.650
Brother...

20:23.720 --> 20:25.360
Flanders...

20:31.090 --> 20:32.730
Huga?

20:50.640 --> 20:52.620
Are you back to normal?

20:53.310 --> 20:54.950
Huga?

20:55.050 --> 20:59.990
Sister, if the screw on the top of an android's
head becomes even a little bit loose,

20:59.990 --> 21:01.790
their behavior becomes unpredictable.

21:01.790 --> 21:03.770
Here's the user's manual.

21:04.730 --> 21:07.190
I..it's so heavy!

21:07.190 --> 21:09.170
Read it this time.

21:10.160 --> 21:12.470
You saved us?

21:12.470 --> 21:14.280
My sisters,

21:16.070 --> 21:18.570
the next time we meet...

21:21.610 --> 21:23.250
Huga.

21:30.020 --> 21:31.850
Let's go home, Flandre.

21:31.850 --> 21:33.490
Huga.

21:36.120 --> 21:37.890
Thous art a sinner!

21:37.890 --> 21:38.930
Huga!

21:38.930 --> 21:40.260
I love getting into trouble!

21:40.260 --> 21:45.260
My, something that fun happened
while I was asleep?

21:45.630 --> 21:47.100
It wasn't fun!

21:47.100 --> 21:49.450
It was incredibly dangerous!

21:52.510 --> 21:55.820
Traveler of the Underworld, Kerberot!

21:56.640 --> 22:00.110
In the name of the gatekeeper of the underworld, Kerberot,

22:00.110 --> 22:00.550
I will force you back from the dead!

22:00.550 --> 22:02.050
Huga!

22:02.050 --> 22:03.690
Hu..ga!

22:13.130 --> 22:18.130
Get down on your knees and lick my red nails

22:18.700 --> 22:26.640
Call me queen with your entangled tongue

22:29.210 --> 22:31.980
The sun that blooms in Hell

22:31.980 --> 22:34.710
Darkness that's fallen to Paradise

22:34.720 --> 22:37.280
If you're confronted with light and despair

22:37.280 --> 22:39.920
Which one goes deeper?

22:39.920 --> 22:42.660
Roses fly from my head

22:42.660 --> 22:45.360
I'll scatter them into Nirvana

22:45.360 --> 22:47.960
Wounds that secretly pain you

22:47.960 --> 22:50.530
Blood that gushes away

22:50.600 --> 22:53.230
They both lead to the depths of my heart

22:53.230 --> 22:55.900
You've given these gorgeous gifts as tribute

22:55.900 --> 22:58.570
And yet you're still

22:58.570 --> 23:01.270
Seeking love?

23:01.280 --> 23:04.010
Tell me exactly to what extent

23:04.010 --> 23:06.680
Grown men are just foolish little boys?

23:06.680 --> 23:11.680
Get down on your knees and lick my sacred feet

23:11.950 --> 23:16.950
Call me queen in your hoarse voice

23:17.390 --> 23:22.390
The proof of your life creeps up the tower of pain

23:22.630 --> 23:25.330
Slowly making your way, you can barely breathe

23:25.330 --> 23:27.970
But if you still ask for it

23:27.970 --> 23:31.940
Your dying breath just might be

23:31.940 --> 23:40.220
The words that melt my frozen tears

23:41.720 --> 23:43.350
Huga...

23:44.520 --> 23:47.760
Oh, Hime! Step on me more lightly...

23:48.060 --> 23:50.720
Hit me a little softer...

23:50.720 --> 23:54.130
Yeah, that's the spot!
Gets me in the pit of my stomach.

23:54.130 --> 23:55.260
Hime...

23:55.260 --> 23:58.770
Hiro, what the heck are you dreaming about?

23:59.700 --> 24:02.340
Next episode, "Princess Comatose"

24:02.340 --> 24:04.470
Not the candle, Hime.

24:04.470 --> 24:07.110
Candle? Wake up, Hiro!

24:07.110 --> 24:07.970
Huga... Huga...
